# Implementation Plan - Final Efficiency Gaps

# Goal Description
Close the final remaining gaps identified in the "Re-Review":
1.  **Admin Panel**: Missing "User/Store Management" and "Audit Logs".
2.  **Accessibility**: Formal verification of WCAG 2.1 AA compliance.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Audit Logs**:
> We must display the `payments` ledger we created in Phase 4 ([services/api/src/payment/ledger.ts](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/services/api/src/payment/ledger.ts)) in the Admin UI.

